#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Build interactive flame graphs from Linux perf without the Perl helpers.

Width is inclusive time: a frame covers itself and everything it called.
The bottom row is the root. Click a frame to zoom, type to search.
cpuflame run, cpuflame attach, and cpuflame system also write a short report of the
hot frames and what to try next.
"""

